<v Guillaume Hachez>Who is a celebrity you'd love to meet? That's a very silly question that I-

401
00:44:16.914 --> 00:44:25.614
<v Alexander De Croo>No, no, it's a good question. Elon Musk.

402
00:44:26.254 --> 00:44:32.424
<v Guillaume Hachez>All right. It came out, I think, yesterday that he was dating the singer Grimes, which-

