410
00:44:46.674 --> 00:44:48.334
<v Guillaume Hachez>I saw them this summer in Paris.

411
00:44:48.734 --> 00:44:48.974
<v Alexander De Croo>Yep.

412
00:44:49.114 --> 00:44:51.994
<v Guillaume Hachez>Favorite concert you've ever been to?

413
00:44:53.034 --> 00:45:00.054
<v Alexander De Croo>Yeah, I think in general, the big Belgian festivals at Rock Werchter or Pukkelpop-

414
00:45:00.214 --> 00:45:00.224
<v Guillaume Hachez>Right

415
00:45:00.224 --> 00:45:01.354
<v Alexander De Croo>... have always been a favorite.

416
00:45:01.474 --> 00:45:05.954
<v Guillaume Hachez>Okay. Where, ooh, where do you see yourself in five years, Mr. De Croo?

417
00:45:06.154 --> 00:45:06.674
<v Alexander De Croo>I have no idea.

418
00:45:07.034 --> 00:45:07.294
<v Guillaume Hachez>Okay.

419
00:45:07.394 --> 00:45:15.273
<v Alexander De Croo>And the good part about life is that sometimes you need to go a bit, go with the flow and not try to plan everything.

420
00:45:15.794 --> 00:45:17.934
<v Guillaume Hachez>Awesome. Well, Mr. De Croo, it's been a pleasure.

421
00:45:18.344 --> 00:45:19.734
<v Alexander De Croo>My pleasure. Good. Thank you.

422
00:45:19.934 --> 00:45:20.254
<v Guillaume Hachez>Goodbye.

423
